@startuml
'https://plantuml.com/sequence-diagram

title System Sequence Diagram US012 update my personal data

autoactivate on
autonumber

actor "Reader" as Administrator
participant ":System" as System

activate Administrator

Administrator -> System: Request to update my personal data
System --> Administrator: requests data to update

Administrator -> System: types requested data
System --> Administrator: shows all data and requests confirmation

Administrator -> System: confirms the data
System --> Administrator: informs operation success
@enduml